            "chunk_type": "isnad",
            "translations": {
              "bn": "",
              "de": "",
              "en": "Al-Husayn ibn Sa'id, from Ibn Abi 'Umayr, from Hammad, from al-Halabi, who said:",
              "es": "",
              "fa": "",
              "fr": "",
              "id": "",
              "ru": "",
              "tr": "",
              "ur": "",
              "zh": ""
            },
            "word_end": 12,
            "word_start": 0
          },
          {
            "arabic_text": "سَأَلْتُ أَبَا عَبْدِ ٱللَّهِ عَلَيْهِ ٱلسَّلَامُ عَنِ ٱلرَّجُلِ يَقْتُلُ ٱبْنَهُ أَيُقْتَلُ بِهِ؟ قَالَ: «لَا، وَلَا يَرِثُ أَحَدُهُمَا ٱلْآخَرَ إِذَا قَتَلَهُ».",
            "chunk_type": "body",
            "translations": {
              "bn": "",
              "de": "",
              "en": "I asked Aba 'Abdillah عليه السلام about a man who kills his son: is he to be killed for him? He said: “No, and neither of the two inherits from the other if he kills him.”",
              "es": "",
              "fa": "",
              "fr": "",
              "id": "",
              "ru": "",
              "tr": "",
              "ur": "",
              "zh": ""
            },
            "word_end": 32,
