          "de": "",
          "en": "This hadith gives a legal ruling concerning a father who kills his son. Imam al-Sadiq عليه السلام states that the father is not subject to retaliatory execution for that killing, and that mutual inheritance is cut off between the killer and the one killed when one of them kills the other.",
